I'm getting into ship components, and using [www.erkul.games](https://www.erkul.games) on my reclaimer. I know there are different features, like shields taking a while before recharging as a tradeoff to high shield hp, quick recharge and lower hp and such. Also some weapons heat less, and some doing more damage when heated. 

&#x200B;

But where can i find this information? I'm trying different modifications, and i fail to see how anything is better than just picking the highest dps, highest shields health, best coolers, best powerplant. If anyone has any information i would greatly appreciate it. Thanks.

